@model BasicFinance.Web.Models.AccountInputModel
@using BasicFinance.Web.Models
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Rendering
<div asp-validation-summary="ModelOnly" class="validation-summary"></div>
<div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-field">
        <label asp-for="Name"></label>
        <input asp-for="Name" autocomplete="off" />
        <span asp-validation-for="Name" class="field-error"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-field">
        <label asp-for="Type"></label>
        <select asp-for="Type" asp-items="Html.GetEnumSelectList<AccountType>()"></select>
        <span asp-validation-for="Type" class="field-error"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-field" id="retirement-type-field" hidden>
        <label asp-for="RetirementType"></label>
        <select asp-for="RetirementType" asp-items="(IEnumerable<SelectListItem>)ViewBag.RetirementTypes">
            <option value="">Choose retirement account type</option>
        </select>
        <span asp-validation-for="RetirementType" class="field-error"></span>
        <small>Select the specific tax-advantaged or pension account you hold.</small>
    </div>
    <div class="form-field" id="debt-type-field" hidden>
        <label asp-for="DebtType"></label>
        <select asp-for="DebtType" asp-items="(IEnumerable<SelectListItem>)ViewBag.DebtTypes">
            <option value="">Choose debt account type</option>
        </select>
        <span asp-validation-for="DebtType" class="field-error"></span>
        <small>Choose the type of liability you want to track.</small>
    </div>
    <div class="form-field">
        <label asp-for="Institution"></label>
        <input asp-for="Institution" autocomplete="organization" />
        <span asp-validation-for="Institution" class="field-error"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-field">
        <label asp-for="CurrencyCode"></label>
        <input asp-for="CurrencyCode" maxlength="3" autocomplete="off" />
        <span asp-validation-for="CurrencyCode" class="field-error"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-field">
        <label asp-for="OpeningBalance"></label>
        <input asp-for="OpeningBalance" type="number" step="0.01" />
        <span asp-validation-for="OpeningBalance" class="field-error"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-field">
        <label asp-for="OpenedOn"></label>
        <input asp-for="OpenedOn" type="date" />
        <span asp-validation-for="OpenedOn" class="field-error"></span>
    </div>
    <div id="debt-details" class="form-field-group" hidden>
        <h3>Debt details</h3>
        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="form-field"><label asp-for="CreditLimit"></label><input asp-for="CreditLimit" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" /><span asp-validation-for="CreditLimit" class="field-error"></span></div>
            <div class="form-field"><label asp-for="MinimumPayment"></label><input asp-for="MinimumPayment" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" /><span asp-validation-for="MinimumPayment" class="field-error"></span></div>
            <div class="form-field"><label asp-for="PaymentDueDay"></label><input asp-for="PaymentDueDay" type="number" min="1" max="31" /><span asp-validation-for="PaymentDueDay" class="field-error"></span></div>
            <div class="form-field"><label asp-for="OriginalLoanAmount"></label><input asp-for="OriginalLoanAmount" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" /><span asp-validation-for="OriginalLoanAmount" class="field-error"></span></div>
            <div class="form-field"><label asp-for="LoanTermMonths"></label><input asp-for="LoanTermMonths" type="number" min="1" max="600" /><span asp-validation-for="LoanTermMonths" class="field-error"></span></div>
            <div class="form-field"><label asp-for="MaturityDate"></label><input asp-for="MaturityDate" type="date" /><span asp-validation-for="MaturityDate" class="field-error"></span></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="retirement-details" class="form-field-group" hidden>
        <h3>Retirement details</h3>
        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="form-field"><label asp-for="EmployerName"></label><input asp-for="EmployerName" autocomplete="organization" /><span asp-validation-for="EmployerName" class="field-error"></span></div>
            <div class="form-field"><label asp-for="EmployerMatchPercent"></label><input asp-for="EmployerMatchPercent" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" /><span asp-validation-for="EmployerMatchPercent" class="field-error"></span></div>
            <div class="form-field"><label asp-for="TaxTreatment"></label><select asp-for="TaxTreatment"><option value="">Not specified</option><option>Traditional / pre-tax</option><option>Roth / after-tax</option><option>Mixed</option><option>Taxable</option><option>Tax-deferred</option><option>Other</option></select><span asp-validation-for="TaxTreatment" class="field-error"></span></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="brokerage-details" class="form-field-group" hidden>
        <h3>Brokerage details</h3>
        <div class="form-field"><label asp-for="BrokerageRegistrationType"></label><select asp-for="BrokerageRegistrationType"><option value="">Not specified</option><option>Individual</option><option>Joint</option><option>Trust</option><option>Custodial</option><option>Other</option></select><span asp-validation-for="BrokerageRegistrationType" class="field-error"></span></div>
    </div>
    <div id="interest-rate-field" class="form-field" hidden>
        <label asp-for="InterestRatePercent"></label><input asp-for="InterestRatePercent" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.001" /><span asp-validation-for="InterestRatePercent" class="field-error"></span>
        <small>Enter the current APR or APY, as applicable.</small>
    </div>
    <div class="form-field form-field-wide">
        <label asp-for="Notes"></label><textarea asp-for="Notes" rows="3" maxlength="1000"></textarea><span asp-validation-for="Notes" class="field-error"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-field">
        <label asp-for="Status"></label>
        <select asp-for="Status" asp-items="Html.GetEnumSelectList<AccountStatus>()"></select>
        <span asp-validation-for="Status" class="field-error"></span>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="form-actions">
    <button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Save account</button>
    <a class="button button-secondary" asp-action="Index">Cancel</a>
</div>

<script>
(() => {
    const accountType = document.getElementById("Type");
    const retirementField = document.getElementById("retirement-type-field");
    const retirementType = document.getElementById("RetirementType");
    const debtField = document.getElementById("debt-type-field");
    const debtType = document.getElementById("DebtType");
    const debtDetails = document.getElementById("debt-details");
    const retirementDetails = document.getElementById("retirement-details");
    const brokerageDetails = document.getElementById("brokerage-details");
    const interestRateField = document.getElementById("interest-rate-field");
    if (!accountType) return;
    const updateSubtypeFields = () => {
        const isRetirement = accountType.value === "@((int)AccountType.Retirement)";
        const isDebt = accountType.value === "@((int)AccountType.Debt)";
        const isCreditCard = accountType.value === "@((int)AccountType.CreditCard)";
        retirementField.hidden = !isRetirement;
        retirementType.required = isRetirement;
        debtField.hidden = !isDebt;
        debtType.required = isDebt;
        debtDetails.hidden = !(isDebt || isCreditCard);
        retirementDetails.hidden = !isRetirement;
        brokerageDetails.hidden = accountType.value !== "@((int)AccountType.Brokerage)";
        interestRateField.hidden = !(isDebt || isCreditCard || ["@((int)AccountType.Checking)", "@((int)AccountType.Savings)"].includes(accountType.value));
        if (!isRetirement) retirementType.value = "";
        if (!isDebt) debtType.value = "";
    };
    accountType.addEventListener("change", updateSubtypeFields);
    updateSubtypeFields();
})();
</script>
